{
  "statement": "The requirements I propose focus on enhancing the performance efficiency of the bookkeeping system. EFF-01 ensures rapid processing of transactions, while EFF-02 supports a high number of concurrent users for optimal throughput. EFF-03 minimizes memory usage, contributing to resource optimization. EFF-04 guarantees quick report generation, and EFF-05 reduces latency through caching. EFF-06 ensures timely currency conversion, and EFF-07 maintains a swift audit trail logging. Together, these requirements ensure the system operates efficiently and responsively.",
  "conflicts_raised": [
    {"ids": ["SAF-04", "EFF-01"], "type": "logical", "description": "EFF-01's requirement for processing speed may conflict with SAF-04's need for thorough error handling."},
    {"ids": ["TRU-05", "EFF-01"], "type": "logical", "description": "EFF-01's requirement for processing speed may conflict with TRU-05's two-factor authentication, potentially impacting user experience."},
    {"ids": ["SAF-06", "EFF-06"], "type": "logical", "description": "SAF-06's validation of currency conversions may introduce latency that conflicts with EFF-06's requirement for timely currency conversion."}
  ],
